# Third-party licences

ShamsaInk's reader is one program built from the libraries below. Each one's licence, with its copyright notices as its
authors give them, follows. Made by reader/scripts/licenses.sh from the crates and modules actually built into it.

Blitz (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz) is built with three changes of ours, and Parley
(https://github.com/linebender/parley) with one (from its pull request 907), published in ShamsaInk's repository
(engine/patches/). The crates under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (Stylo and its crates, Symphonia) are used
unchanged; their source is at crates.io and in their repositories (https://github.com/servo/stylo,
https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia).

